sysinfo.txt
*.stackdump

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

# Builds / packages
*.apk
*.aab
*.unitypackage
*.app

# Burst / IL2CPP / Addressables caches
BurstDebugInformation_DoNotShip/
**/StreamingAssets/aa/*
!**/StreamingAssets/aa/settings.json

# Local embedded UPM copies (resolved via Package Manager registry)
Packages/com.unity.burst@*/
Packages/com.unity.collections@*/
Packages/com.unity.mathematics@*/
Packages/com.unity.postprocessing@*/

# Secrets — never commit API keys
**/Secrets/
**/secrets.json
**/*ApiKey*
**/.env
**/api_keys.*

# Misc
*.log
Recordings/
InitTestScene*.unity*